Huh?

511
00:31:06,540 --> 00:31:08,160
It was you?

512
00:31:25,680 --> 00:31:28,480
Street General, Katakuri! Could he?

513
00:31:32,860 --> 00:31:34,180
Why'd you kill him?

514
00:31:34,480 --> 00:31:36,480
This is what he was gonna say.

515
00:31:37,100 --> 00:31:38,620
I'm just one guest.

516
00:31:38,840 --> 00:31:40,252
Why should Big Mom care?

517
00:31:40,360 --> 00:31:41,831
Do you know what she did?

518
00:31:42,980 --> 00:31:47,020
She sent me a box with my
poor sick father's head in it.

519
00:31:47,780 --> 00:31:50,940
I'm here today to finally get my revenge.

520
00:31:51,360 --> 00:31:52,620
Now open the gate.

521
00:31:53,620 --> 00:31:54,450
Bang.

522
00:31:55,560 --> 00:31:56,390
Bang.

523
00:31:56,473 --> 00:31:57,733
He fires his gun again.

524
00:31:58,060 --> 00:32:02,500
Two of your men go down,
taken completely by surprise.

525
00:32:04,380 --> 00:32:09,027
So I threw a jelly bean at him to stop
that undesirable outcome from happening.

526
00:32:10,220 --> 00:32:11,279
Is that a problem?

527
00:32:11,980 --> 00:32:13,220
Rook, Buggy?

528
00:32:15,580 --> 00:32:18,020
Tell Mama that it was my call.

529
00:32:20,720 --> 00:32:23,220
I know what you're gonna say next.

530
00:32:24,340 --> 00:32:25,400
I see.

531
00:32:26,260 --> 00:32:27,540
All right, then.

532
00:32:30,700 --> 00:32:34,277
This Bruno, he is going to be
a pain in the ass at the party.

533
00:32:34,360 --> 00:32:38,097
He trained his observation Haki so
much he can see into the future,

534
00:32:38,180 --> 00:32:40,117
for a couple of seconds at least.

535
00:32:40,200 --> 00:32:42,494
The bastard's bounty is over a billion.

536
00:32:42,740 --> 00:32:43,740
He's a monster.

537
00:32:45,660 --> 00:32:46,520
I see.

538
00:32:46,860 --> 00:32:47,840
All right, then.

539
00:32:49,360 --> 00:32:51,125
Seems like the time's arrived.

540
00:33:14,320 --> 00:33:17,180
Finally, the tea party is here.

541
00:33:25,140 --> 00:33:27,097
Why hello there?

542
00:33:27,180 --> 00:33:29,160
Thank you for coming out!

543
00:33:38,200 --> 00:33:41,557
Sweet as far as the eye can see!

544
00:33:41,640 --> 00:33:46,240
So raise those glasses
and everybody be happy?

545
00:33:53,980 --> 00:33:55,960
Come on, eat!

546
00:33:57,100 --> 00:33:58,460
And drink!

547
00:33:59,300 --> 00:34:01,620
Have the time of your life!

548
00:34:01,920 --> 00:34:04,440
Because this is a very special day.

549
00:34:07,060 --> 00:34:09,860
We've got some wonderful surprises.

550
00:34:11,060 --> 00:34:13,780
I'm sure they'll knock you off your feet.

551
00:34:17,280 --> 00:34:19,760
Thank you.
